      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORNADO ETHICS (8) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 1.5 lengths at Maitland in a handy 22.26 beating Miss Arizona. Well placed and can measure up. FLASH JET (7) was in the placings last time but prior to that posted a lightning 17.89 win over 320m at Richmond. Has the ability and can find winning form again. LITTLE BIT SUPER (2) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Ripped Raccoon (17.77) in a NG. Was in the money prior to that. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Should be about the money. MIDNIGHT FURY (1) looks an each-way chance.",
